msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COLA.NAME"
msgid "Cola"
msgstr "可乐"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COLA.DESC"
msgid "A sweet-and-spicy carbonated drink. Pincha Peppernut and sucrose, in perfect proportion, warm you right through."
msgstr "一种甜辣的碳酸饮料，火椒和蔗糖的完美作用能极大地暖心！"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.BEVERAGEMIXER.NAME"
msgid "Beverage Mixer"
msgstr "饮料调配机"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.BEVERAGEMIXER.DESC"
msgid "A machine that blends liquids, gases and spices in exact proportions."
msgstr "一台把液体、气体和香料按比例混合的机器。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.BEVERAGEMIXER.EFFECT"
msgid "Blends ingredients into assorted beverages."
msgstr "将原料调配成各种饮品。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.DUPLICANTDRANKCOLA.NAME"
msgid "Drank Cola"
msgstr "喝了可乐"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.DUPLICANTDRANKCOLA.TOOLTIP"
msgid "A chilled glass of Cola. Stress melts away, spirits lift."
msgstr "一杯冰镇可乐，压力消散，精神百倍。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.BEVERAGEMIXER.RECIPE_NAME"
msgid "Cola"
msgstr "可乐"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.BEVERAGEMIXER.RECIPE_DESC"
msgid "Water, Carbon Dioxide, Sucrose and Pincha Peppernut, fused under pressure into a glass of Cola."
msgstr "水、二氧化碳、蔗糖和火椒粒在高压下融合成一杯可乐。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SUPERCAPACITOR.NAME"
msgid "Super Capacitor Bank"
msgstr "超级电容库"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SUPERCAPACITOR.DESC"
msgid "A rack of high-density supercapacitors. It holds far more charge than an ordinary battery and keeps a grid running long after the generators stop."
msgstr "一组高密度超级电容。储电量远超普通电池，即使发电机停摆，也能让电网继续运转很久。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SUPERCAPACITOR.EFFECT"
msgid "Stores up to <b>800 kJ</b> of Power.\n\nLeaks 50 J per second to internal resistance and emits 50 DTU/s of Heat.\n\nSends a Green Signal when its charge rises above the activation threshold."
msgstr "最多储存 <b>800 千焦</b>电力。\n\n因内阻每秒泄漏 50 焦耳，并产生 50 复制热/秒。\n\n电量高于启动阈值时输出绿色信号。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SUPERCAPACITOR.LOGIC_PORT"
msgid "Battery Charge"
msgstr "电池电量"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SUPERCAPACITOR.LOGIC_PORT_ACTIVE"
msgid "Sends a <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> when the charge rises above the activation threshold"
msgstr "电量高于启动阈值时输出<b><style=\"logic_on\">绿色信号</style></b>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SUPERCAPACITOR.LOGIC_PORT_INACTIVE"
msgid "Sends a <b><style=\"logic_off\">Red Signal</style></b> when the charge falls below the deactivation threshold"
msgstr "电量低于停止阈值时输出<b><style=\"logic_off\">红色信号</style></b>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWEETCANE.NAME"
msgid "Sweet Cane"
msgstr "甜蔗"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWEETCANE.DESC"
msgid "A variant of Salty Sticks, with sucrose crystals growing along its stalk. Duplicants adore eating it, but the osmotic pressure from all that sugar leaves them thirsty."
msgstr "咸蔗的变种，茎秆上析出蔗糖晶体。复制人很喜欢吃，但糖分带来的渗透压会导致口渴。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWEETCANE.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant has been domesticated and needs irrigation to grow."
msgstr "这种植物经过驯化，需要灌溉才能生长。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SEEDS.SWEETCANE.NAME"
msgid "Sweet Cane Seed"
msgstr "甜蔗种子"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SEEDS.SWEETCANE.DESC"
msgid "The seed of a Sweet Cane. Plant it to harvest Sweet Cane."
msgstr "甜蔗的种子。种下后可以收获甜蔗。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWEETCANE.NAME"
msgid "Sweet Cane"
msgstr "甜蔗"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWEETCANE.DESC"
msgid "A variant of Salty Sticks, its stalk studded with crystallised sucrose. Duplicants love it, but it leaves them thirsty."
msgstr "咸蔗的变种，茎秆上结着析出的蔗糖晶体。复制人很爱吃，但吃完会口渴。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SWEETCANE.TITLE"
msgid "Sweet Cane"
msgstr "甜蔗"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SWEETCANE.SUBTITLE"
msgid "A variant of Salty Sticks"
msgstr "咸蔗的变种"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SWEETCANE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Sweet Cane is a variant of Salty Sticks. Its stalk bears crystallised sucrose, formed naturally as sugar accumulates between the fibres.\n\nDuplicants are very fond of eating Sweet Cane.\n\nBut Sweet Cane contains far too much sugar, and the osmotic pressure it brings leaves whoever eats it thirsty."
msgstr "甜蔗是咸蔗的变种。它的茎秆上有着析出的蔗糖晶体，那是糖分在纤维间富集之后自然形成的。\n\n复制人很喜欢吃甜蔗。\n\n不过甜蔗的糖分实在太多，食用后带来的渗透压会导致口渴。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.SWEETCANE_CRUSH.RECIPE_NAME"
msgid "Sucrose and Plant Fiber"
msgstr "蔗糖与植物外壳"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.SWEETCANE_CRUSH.RECIPE_DESC"
msgid "Sweet Cane run through the crusher, split into its sugar and its fibre."
msgstr "把甜蔗投入碎石机，分离出其中的蔗糖与植物外壳。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COFFEETREE.NAME"
msgid "Coffee Tree"
msgstr "咖啡树"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COFFEETREE.DESC"
msgid "A close relative of the Pincha Peppernut Vine. Its fruit has lost all of the peppernut's heat, but carries a far higher concentration of caffeine.\n\nIt spends most of its life slowly laying down a woody stem, making it a painfully slow crop to grow, but it asks for nothing except abundant light."
msgstr "火椒藤的近亲。它的果实失去了火椒粒的辛辣，但咖啡因浓度要高得多。\n\n它一生大部分时间都在缓慢地长出木质化的茎，因此生长期长得出奇地煎熬，但它除充足的光照外一无所求。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COFFEETREE.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant has been domesticated. It does not need fertiliser, but demands strong light to grow."
msgstr "这株植物已被培育。它不需要施肥，但需要强光才能生长。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SEEDS.COFFEETREE.NAME"
msgid "Coffee Tree Seed"
msgstr "咖啡树种子"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SEEDS.COFFEETREE.DESC"
msgid "The seed of a Coffee Tree. Plant it in bright light to harvest Coffee Beans."
msgstr "咖啡树的种子。把它种在光照充足的地方即可收获咖啡豆。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COFFEEBEAN.NAME"
msgid "Coffee Bean"
msgstr "咖啡豆"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COFFEEBEAN.DESC"
msgid "The roasted seed of a Coffee Tree. It has no flavour worth eating on its own, but brewed properly it will wake a Duplicant right up."
msgstr "咖啡树的烘焙种子。直接吃毫无风味可言，但煮得好的话能让复制人一下子清醒过来。"
